<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Information on data handling and inquiries for the Trade90 website." canonical="/privacy/">
<main class="wrap"><article class="article"><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Trade90</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Updated 21 October 2026</p></header>
<h2>Browsing the website</h2><p>You can view Trade90's rate comparisons and educational guides without signing in. Web hosting and security providers may process technical request information, such as IP addresses, timestamps, browser details and request logs, to deliver and protect the website.</p>
<h2>Google Analytics</h2><p>With your permission, we use Google Analytics to measure page views and website usage. Analytics loads after you accept; declining keeps Google Analytics from loading on subsequent pages. Your choice is saved in this browser. Use Analytics preferences in the footer to change it. Advertising personalization and Google signals are disabled.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>If you email us, we may retain the email and the content you provide to respond to your inquiry or correction request. Do not include broker passwords or sensitive financial credentials.</p>
<h2>Optional Google accounts and dashboard sync</h2><p>When Google sign-in is enabled, you can create an account or sign in through Google and Supabase. Google supplies basic profile information and your email for authentication. We do not request Gmail or Google Drive access. Supabase stores account information and manages sessions; session credentials are stored in your browser to keep you signed in.</p><p>When you choose Save dashboard, we store your selected currency pairs and a snapshot of the public research you viewed in your private account workspace. This supports cross-device watchlists and comparisons. Guest watchlists and comparison snapshots remain in browser storage. Account data is protected by owner-only database access policies. Signing out does not delete your cloud dashboard; guest selections are stored separately.</p><p>Existing account and legacy workspace records remain stored. To request account or workspace deletion, contact the address below. Dashboard saving and authentication do not require accepting analytics cookies.</p>
<h2>Other services</h2><p>Hosting, performance measurement and advertising arrangements may change. Where optional analytics, advertising or similar technologies are used, applicable provider policies and consent requirements should be reviewed separately. This page does not mean that previous browser cookies or offline caches have been removed from every device.</p>
<h2>Data requests</h2><p>For privacy inquiries, write to <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:admin@tradeninety.com">admin@tradeninety.com</a><!--/email_off-->.</p></article></main>
</Layout>
